{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344740/extras/69835bf8d03caf2b6b07181fc41bb5cb.avif?t=1773681553\" width=1000 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Hunk Empire, where dreams, ambition, and secrets intertwine in the heart of California.</strong> In this visual novel, you play a young man thrust into a world he barely understands. A world of adult entertainment, family legacies, and risky opportunities. After being kicked out by your mother, you\u2019re forced to rebuild your life under the shadow of your estranged father, Leonard King, a controversial adult industry mogul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunk Empire is a explicit visual novel/lite business management game made in Full HD, with the following themes; Gay, Romance, Humor, Polyamory, Group Sex, Muscle Worship.<strong></strong><br><br> <br>This game contains the <u><strong>Arc 1 storyline</strong>.</u> Future arcs will become available as DLC.<strong> </strong><br> Studio upgrades become available<strong>\u00a0as the story progresses across the different arcs.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344740/extras/ec851fb9148c3f03fd7f7f54f58ca8b8.avif?t=1773681553\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344740/extras_big/ec851fb9148c3f03fd7f7f54f58ca8b8.avif?t=1773681553 width=1560 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344740/extras/6abc5dfbf9d32b87b722958fd36e254f.avif?t=1773681553\" width=1000 height=260 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Arc 1 (Season) story line.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>800+ CG Full HD images!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>42 Sex scenes to unlock!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>12 Sexy Hunks to meet, get to know... and to have fun with.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50K+ words</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 Steam Achievements</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Extensive gallery system with control keys for one-handed use.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Story line taking you deep into the adult industry, both behind as in front of the camera.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge soundtrack with music fitting to the M.C's mood.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character book with details and lore about the characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3344740/extras/46cae74b3766b045e61eb8ae2e87c6b9.avif?t=1773681553\" width=1000 height=260 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you navigate the vibrant yet gritty streets of Riveroaks, you\u2019ll forge connections, make tough choices, and carve out your own path. Will you rise to the challenge of running your father\u2019s newly-founded gay-focused studio, or will you find your own calling amidst the chaos of an industry driven by desire and power? Along the way, you\u2019ll meet a diverse cast of characters, each with their own aspirations, secrets, and unique roles in your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A fresh new start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3344740/0